---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Vehicle Listing Disclaimer"
  description={`Disclaimers concerning vehicle availability, pricing, condition, history and warranties on ${site.name} listings.`}
>
  <p>
    The vehicle information shown on this website is provided for general information only.
    {site.name} makes every reasonable effort to keep listings accurate, but relies in part on
    information supplied by third parties and on the condition of each vehicle at the time of sale.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Pricing</h2>
  <p>
    Listed prices exclude taxes, title, registration, documentation fees, and any other dealer
    charges unless expressly stated. Prices are subject to change without notice, and errors may be
    corrected at any time. A price shown online is not a binding offer.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Availability</h2>
  <p>
    A vehicle shown on the Site may have been sold or reserved before the listing is updated. Please
    confirm availability with us before travelling or making any decision.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Photographs and Descriptions</h2>
  <p>
    Photographs and colour renderings are representative. Equipment, trim, and options shown may not
    be present on the specific vehicle offered. Where a vehicle has been modified (for example with
    aftermarket wheels, body kits, or accessories), those modifications are described to the best of
    our knowledge but may not be exhaustive.
  </p>

  <h2>4. History and Condition</h2>
  <p>
    Vehicle history information, such as CARFAX or similar reports, is provided by third parties and
    is not independently verified by us. Vehicles are used and may have had prior accidents, damage,
    repairs, or paintwork even where not described. We disclose known material history when we are
    aware of it, but a clean history report is not a guarantee of a vehicle's condition.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Warranties</h2>
  <p>
    Unless a specific written warranty is provided for a vehicle, all used vehicles are sold
    <strong>"as is."</strong> Any warranty description on this Site (including references to
    warranty programs) is subject to the terms of the actual written warranty document, which is the
    only source of warranty rights. The FTC Buyer's Guide posted on each used vehicle governs the
    warranty status of that vehicle.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Odometer</h2>
  <p>
    Odometer readings are provided as required by federal law. We do not guarantee that a displayed
    reading reflects the vehicle's total mileage, particularly where the odometer has been replaced,
    is inoperative, or has reached its mechanical limits, unless a written odometer disclosure
    states otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Service Estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Any service or repair estimate shown or quoted is preliminary and is based on a visual or
    diagnostic inspection. Final pricing depends on the work actually required and authorised.
  </p>

  <h2>8. No Legal or Financial Advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this Site constitutes legal, tax, financial, or insurance advice. You are responsible
    for obtaining independent professional advice regarding any vehicle purchase or finance
    arrangement.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about a specific listing, contact {site.name} at
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
